title: Agent Adoption Contracts, Scoped Permissions, Shift Guarantees — Team Design Complete
summary: 'Full team analysis (Architect, Advocate, Jinx) across 3 rounds on two connected proposals: (1) extending Documentor to maintain university content, (2) per-project agent preferences on activation. Documentor extension reshaped into a broader agent adoption system with scoped permissions (EULA-style), guaranteed file creation in paradigm shift, and post-shift recommendations. Team unanimously approved for implementation with 3 conditions from Jinx.'
symbols_touched:
  - '#shift'
  - '#agent-identity'
  - '#documentor'
  - '#university'
  - '#orchestration'
  - '#agent-loader'
  - '#roster'
  - '#enforcement-hooks'
